      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No alert when prices rise. We tell you ‘time to sell’ when the price falls the amount you set from its peak, or reaches your target price. We check prices when you open the app and when iOS allows while it's idle (usually every few hours) — it's not live monitoring."
