          }
        }
      }
    },
    "하루 24시간 + 돈으로 되찾은 %@" : {
      "comment" : "A description of how much time the user will have after spending their earnings over a day. The argument is the string “0시간”, the string “%arg시간”, or the string “%arg시간”.",
