    "하루 기준으로 지출 %@ · 되찾은 시간 %@" : {
      "comment" : "A description of the total cost of the day and the time it would take to earn that money. The first argument is the string “0원” or the string “%arg원”. The second argument is the string “0시간”, the string “%arg시간”, or the string “%arg시간”.",
